    "blurb": "",
    "source": "# A whole package family from one template.\n# Template parameters are plain identifiers (keywords like `span`/`pitch`\n# can't be parameter names), bound as footprint-scoped lets at instantiation.\n\ntemplate soic(n, lspan = 6.0, e = 1.27, bw = 3.9) {\n  body bw x (n/2 - 1) * e + 2.0 x 1.5\n  pins n dual pitch e\n  lead gullwing 0.41 x 1.04 span lspan\n  pin1 dot\n}\n\nfootprint \"SOIC-8\"  from soic(8)\nfootprint \"SOIC-14\" from soic(14)\nfootprint \"SOIC-16\" from soic(16)\n\nfootprint \"SOIC-16W\" from soic(16, lspan = 10.3, bw = 7.5) {\n  description \"wide-body 300 mil variant\"\n}\n\n# Inheritance also composes with templates:\nfootprint \"SOIC-8-HS\" extends \"SOIC-8\" {\n  description \"hand-solder variant\"\n  default pad rect 0.6 x 2.2\n  courtyard auto 0.5\n}\n"
